### Get All Comment
GET /api/news/{{ owner_news_id }}/comments HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token2 }}

### Owner workspace Create Comment
POST /api/comments HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token1 }}

{
  "news_id": {{ owner_workspace_id }},
  "content": "string"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("owner_comment_id", response.body.comment.comment_id)
%}


### Member workspace Create Comment
POST /api/comments HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token2 }}

{
  "news_id": {{ owner_workspace_id }},
  "content": "string"
}

### Owner(Comment) update comment
PUT /api/comments/{{ owner_comment_id }} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token1 }}

{
  "content": "strinsdasdag"
}

### Another Member update comment THIS CAN NOT DO
PUT /api/comments/{{ owner_comment_id }} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token2 }}

{
    "content": "strinsdasdag"
}

### Owner(Comment) Delate comment
DELETE /api/comments/{{ owner_comment_id }} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token1 }}

### Anothe Member Delate comment
DELETE /api/comments/3 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Host: localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{ token2 }}







